    ItemText{"Armor_005_Head", "Cap of the Wild", "According to legend, this cap was crafted for\na hero who travels the wild lands. Wearing it\njust feels so right."},
    ItemText{"Armor_005_Lower", "Trousers of the Wild", "Legends say these pants were tailored for a\nhero who travels the wilderness. Strangely\nenough, they're the most comfortable pair\nof pants you've ever worn."},
    ItemText{"Armor_005_Upper", "Tunic of the Wild", "This armor was apparently crafted for a hero\nwho travels the wilds. Strangely enough,\nit's just your size."},
    ItemText{"Armor_006_Head", "Zora Helm", "Zora headgear made from dragon scales.\nIncreases swimming speed and allows\nyou to use Spin Attack."},
    ItemText{"Armor_006_Lower", "Zora Greaves", "These greaves have been passed down\namong the Zora for generations. It's been\nsaid they're crafted using dragon scales.\nEquip them to swim faster."},
    ItemText{"Armor_006_Upper", "Zora Armor", "Custom armor painstakingly crafted by each\ngeneration's Zora princess for her future \nhusband. Wearing it will give you the ability\nto swim up waterfalls."},
