    ItemText{"Armor_042_Upper", "Stealth Chest Guard", "Armor designed for stealth, passed down\nthrough the Sheikah tribe. Its special fabric\nsuppresses sound. A Great Fairy has\nincreased its defense by one level."},
    ItemText{"Armor_043_Lower", "Well-Worn Trousers", "These old trousers are threadbare in\nspots, but they're surprisingly comfortable.\nThe legs are a bit too short, though."},
    ItemText{"Armor_043_Upper", "Old Shirt", "A thin shirt made long ago. It's coming apart\nat the seams, but it's better than nothing.\nThe sleeves are a bit on the short side."},
    ItemText{"Armor_044_Upper", "Warm Doublet", "A warm pullover typically worn by mountain\nfolk. Its sturdy fabric and thick gloves are\ngreat at retaining body heat."},
    ItemText{"Armor_045_Head", "Moblin Mask", "Kilton's handmade Moblin headgear. It's\ndesigned to replicate the Moblin's distinct\nlong nose and large horn. Equip it to\nblend in with Moblins."},
    ItemText{"Armor_046_Head", "Rubber Helm", "A helmet made from ancient techniques and\nelectricity-resistant material. It's made from\nsomething called \"rubber,\" a material that\ncan no longer be found."},
    ItemText{"Armor_046_Lower", "Rubber Tights", "These invaluable tights are resistant to\nelectricity. They're made with something\ncalled \"rubber,\" an ancient technology\nthat no longer exists in this modern age."},
    ItemText{"Armor_046_Upper", "Rubber Armor", "This armor has built-in electricity resistance\nthanks to its source material—an ancient\nmarvel called \"rubber.\" Such technology\ndoes not exist in this modern age."},
    ItemText{"Armor_048_Head", "Barbarian Helm", "A helmet once worn by the warriors of an\nancient warlike tribe from the Faron region.\nWearing it draws out your inner animal,\nincreasing your strength and battle prowess."},
    ItemText{"Armor_048_Lower", "Barbarian Leg Wraps", "These leg wraps were favored by a warlike\ntribe from the Faron region long ago. They're\nadorned with traditional markings that bolster\nyour fighting spirit to raise your attack power."},
    ItemText{"Armor_048_Upper", "Barbarian Armor", "Armor once favored by an ancient warlike\ntribe from the Faron region. The war paint\nbolsters your fighting spirit and raises\nyour attack power."},
    ItemText{"Armor_049_Lower", "Sand Boots", "Gerudo artisans modified these boots for life\nin the desert. The special soles distribute\nyour body weight evenly so you can maintain\nyour normal movement speed on sand."},
    ItemText{"Armor_053_Head", "Gerudo Veil", "A mask worn by Gerudo women. It protects\nthe skin from the harsh sun, but don't expect\nit to protect much in combat..."},
    ItemText{"Armor_053_Lower", "Gerudo Sirwal", "Gerudo favor this traditional sirwal. Its short\nlength allows for ease of movement, and its\nsubtle design is quite fashionable."},
    ItemText{"Armor_053_Upper", "Gerudo Top", "Standard Gerudo garb popular for its open,\nbreathable design and for the traditional\nGerudo markings that adorn it."},
    ItemText{"Armor_055_Head", "Lizalfos Mask", "Kilton's handmade Lizalfos headgear. It's\ndesigned to replicate the unique tongue and\nhorn of the Lizalfos. Equip it to blend in\nwith Lizalfos."},
    ItemText{"Armor_056_Head", "Lynel Mask", "Kilton's handmade Lynel headgear. It's so\nwell crafted, it can deceive a real Lynel.\nEquip it to blend in with Lynels, but don't\nlinger too long. Those beasts are smart."},
