    ItemText{"IceArrow", "Ice Arrow", "An arrow imbued with the power of ice.\nIt breaks apart on impact, freezing\nobjects in the immediate area. It's\nincredibly effective against hot things."},
    ItemText{"Item_Boiled_01", "Hard-Boiled Egg", "A bird egg boiled using water from naturally\noccurring hot springs. It's popular among\nchildren and is easy to make."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_01", "Frozen Bass", "That's one cold fish. Eating it won't restore\nmany hearts, but it will lower your body\ntemperature a bit."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_02", "Frozen Hearty Salmon", "This salmon doesn't taste quite as fishy\nbecause the excess fat has been removed.\nIt's exceptionally cold, so eating it provides\na temporary boost to heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_03", "Frozen Trout", "Being frozen has condensed the taste\nof fish inside this trout's body. Eating it\nwill provide a temporary boost to your\nheat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_04", "Frozen Carp", "The crunchy, icy texture of this chilled\ncarp is quite the delicacy. Eating it will\ntemporarily increase your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_05", "Frozen Porgy", "This frozen porgy is the ideal snack for hiking\nthrough hot climates like the Gerudo Desert.\nEating it provides a temporary boost to your\nheat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_06", "Frozen Hearty Bass", "This hearty bass has been frozen by cold air.\nEating it will be a challenge because it's\nfrozen solid, but if you persevere, it will\ntemporarily increase your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_07", "Frozen Crab", "Doesn't provide as much companionship as\nan unfrozen crab, but it won't spoil during\nyour travels. Eat it to gain a temporary boost\nto your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_08", "Frozen River Snail", "The distinct glow of this sneaky river snail\nhas diminished after it's been frozen, but\neating it like this will provide a temporary\nincrease to your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_ChilledFish_09", "Icy Hearty Blueshell Snail", "It takes a skilled chef to get the meat out of\nthis frozen hearty blueshell snail. Eating this\nwill provide a temporary increase to your\nheat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_Chilled_01", "Icy Meat", "A frozen slab of animal meat. If you can\nmanage to chew it up and swallow it, you'll\nrestore some hearts and lower your body\ntemperature."},
    ItemText{"Item_Chilled_02", "Icy Prime Meat", "High-quality, frozen animal meat. Doesn't\nrestore many hearts, but it can lower your\nbody temperature."},
    ItemText{"Item_Chilled_03", "Icy Gourmet Meat", "This raw gourmet meat has been frozen for\neasy traveling. It's kept its flavor through the\nfreezing process. Eating it as is will provide\na temporary boost to your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_Chilled_04", "Frozen Bird Drumstick", "It's as hard as a rock but is supposedly\nedible. It restores a small number of hearts\nand has a cooling effect."},
    ItemText{"Item_Chilled_05", "Frozen Bird Thigh", "High-quality, frozen bird meat. It's so solid it\nlooks like it could be used as a weapon.\nEating it will restore some hearts and cool\nyou down, but don't break your teeth on it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Chilled_06", "Frozen Whole Bird", "This raw whole bird may have been\nfrozen solid, but its flavor remains intact.\nEating it will provide a temporary boost\nto your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_01", "Mushroom Skewer", "This simple mushroom-packed skewer has its\ncolorful presentation to thank for its appeal."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_02", "Steamed Mushrooms", "A healthy vegetable dish achieved by\nsteaming mushrooms in plant leaves."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_03", "Steamed Fruit", "A regional dish made by steaming near-\nripened fruits in the leaves of fragrant plants."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_04", "Steamed Fish", "A refined dish made by wrapping a fresh fish\nin fragrant wild greens and cooking it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_05", "Steamed Meat", "This meat dish has been wrapped in fragrant\nleaves and steamed to preserve its moisture."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_07", "Fruit and Mushroom Mix", "This dish contrasts the sweetness of fruit with\nthe savoriness of mushrooms."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_08", "Fish and Mushroom Skewer", "A simple dish made by cooking skewered,\nfresh fish alongside fragrant mushrooms."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_09", "Meat and Mushroom Skewer", "A filling dish made by grilling various\nmountain ingredients with meat."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_10", "Omelet", "This simple dish is common all over Hyrule.\nSimply fry egg until it's nice and plump."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_11", "Glazed Mushrooms", "The honey in this mushroom dish gives it a\nsweet, complex taste and a savory finish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_12", "Glazed Meat", "The sweetness of the honey permeates the\nmeat, giving it a complex taste profile."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_13", "Glazed Seafood", "A seafood dish that you can actually\nwolf down whole!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_A_14", "Glazed Veggies", "Don't like the taste of vegetables? Simply\nsauté them in honey for a salty-sweet flavor!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_01", "Fried Wild Greens", "A basic vegetable dish made by sautéing\nfresh wild plants."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_02", "Simmered Fruit", "This sweet dish is made by heaping tasty\nfruits into a pan and simmering until tender."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_05", "Fish Skewer", "A simple dish made by cooking chunks of\nfresh fish on a skewer."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_06", "Meat Skewer", "A juicy, filling snack made by grilling small\nchunks of meat on a skewer."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_11", "Copious Fried Wild Greens", "A healthy dish made by cooking mixed \ngreens over a strong flame."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_12", "Copious Simmered Fruit", "The flavors of the various fruits in this\nsimmered dish exist in perfect harmony."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_13", "Copious Mushroom Skewers", "Fans of fungal cuisine can't resist this simple\nmushroom-skewer dish. Very filling."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_15", "Copious Seafood Skewers", "It's just a whole heap of stuff shoved on to a\nskewer, but it's still a pretty tasty dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_16", "Copious Meat Skewers", "Just shove a bunch of meat on to a skewer\nand you're good to go."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_17", "Meat and Seafood Fry", "A filling dish made by cooking fresh seafood\nand meat together."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_18", "Prime Meat and Seafood Fry", "This comfort dish is made with choice cuts\nof meat and seafood."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_19", "Gourmet Meat and Seafood Fry", "A marriage of the choicest cuts of meat and\nseafood. As delicious as it is filling!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_20", "Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin", "This hollow, meat-filled fortified pumpkin is a\nlocal specialty of Kakariko Village."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_21", "Sautéed Peppers", "The spiciness of these sautéed peppers has\nbeen broken by the heat for a sweeter taste."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_22", "Sautéed Nuts", "These sautéed tree seeds are the perfect\nsnack for the busy adventurer on the go!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_B_23", "Seafood Skewer", "The natural water in this medley of seafaring\ncreatures makes for a delicious broth."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_C_16", "Fairy Tonic", "This powerful recovery elixir harnesses the\npower of fairies. It has a sweet fragrance."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_C_17", "Elixir", ""},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_C_17_00", "Elixir x", ""},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_01", "Salt-Grilled Mushrooms", "A basic mushroom dish made by lightly\nsalting mushrooms and grilling them."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_02", "Salt-Grilled Greens", "A health-boosting dish made with leafy\ngreens and a touch of salt."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_03", "Salt-Grilled Fish", "A simple dish made by rolling a whole fish in\nnatural rock salt before grilling it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_04", "Salt-Grilled Meat", "Short on ingredients? Just rub some meat in\nsalt and cook it for a simple, tasty dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_05", "Salt-Grilled Prime Meat", "A simple yet exquisite dish made by grilling\nhigh-quality meat on top of rock salt."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_06", "Salt-Grilled Gourmet Meat", "This lavish grilled dish makes liberal use of\nhigh-quality cuts of meat."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_07", "Pepper Steak", "The meat has been cooked in crushed\npeppers to accent its natural taste."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_08", "Pepper Seafood", "The pepper seeds grilled with this seafood\ndraw out its taste and pleasant aroma."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_09", "Salt-Grilled Crab", "Nine out of ten fishermen agree: crab is best\nenjoyed grilled and with just a bit of salt."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_D_10", "Crab Stir-Fry", "The Goron spice used in preparing this crab\npairs perfectly with the flavor of its meat."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_E_01", "Poultry Pilaf", "Sautéed Hylian rice steamed in poultry\nbroth. Cook on low heat until the rice is fluffy."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_E_02", "Prime Poultry Pilaf", "The rice permeates the savory taste of the\npoultry in this Gerudo-region favorite."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_E_03", "Gourmet Poultry Pilaf", "Made with the highest-quality poultry, every\nbite of this pilaf floods your mouth with flavor."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_E_04", "Fried Egg and Rice", "The soft egg yolk pairs well with the fresh\nrice in this simple dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_F_01", "Creamy Meat Soup", "This nutritious soup contains serious portions\nof lightly-braised meat and many vegetables."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_F_02", "Creamy Seafood Soup", "Thick-cut chunks of seafood and stock\nprovides a satisfying savoriness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_F_03", "Veggie Cream Soup", "This creamy soup showcases the sweetness\nof vegetables in a veritable taste explosion."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_F_04", "Creamy Heart Soup", "Enjoying this sweet soup with another person\nwill bring you both closer together."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_02", "Seafood Rice Balls", "Stuffed with aromatic seafood, the flavor can\nvary by ingredients but never disappoints."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_03", "Veggie Rice Balls", "This home-style dish of Kakariko Village is\nstuffed with the bounty of the mountains."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_04", "Mushroom Rice Balls", "The aroma of the mushrooms tickles your\nnose as you peel back the leafy wrapping."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_05", "Meat and Rice Bowl", "This dish of rice and lightly seared meat is a\nmainstay all throughout Hyrule."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_06", "Prime Meat and Rice Bowl", "This bowl is loaded with high-quality meat.\nYour hunt for a serious meal ends here."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_09", "Gourmet Meat and Rice Bowl", "Only the most carefully selected cuts of high-\nquality meats go into this dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_10", "Seafood Fried Rice", "Various seafood has been sautéed with rice.\nThe stronger the flame, the tastier the dish!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_11", "Curry Pilaf", "The Goron spice used in this pilaf has given\nit a rich, spicy aroma."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_12", "Mushroom Risotto", "The tantalizing aroma of mushrooms and\nbutter beckons you to the table."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_13", "Vegetable Risotto", "The sweetness of the ingredients\ngives this risotto a mild flavor."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_14", "Salmon Risotto", "The rice used in this rich risotto permeates\nthe light flavor of the salmon."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_15", "Meaty Rice Balls", "The sweet and spicy meat stuffed into these\nrice balls will keep you full for some time."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_16", "Crab Omelet with Rice", "The fluffy crab legs pair perfectly with the\nrice for a truly scrumptious dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_G_17", "Crab Risotto", "An everyday staple of seaside villages, the\nsecret to its delicious flavor lies in crab fat."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_H_01", "Seafood Meunière", "Rich butter flanks fresh seafood. The secret\ningredient is lots and lots of love."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_H_02", "Porgy Meunière", "Popular among residents of coastal regions,\nthis juicy porgy is a delish dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_H_03", "Salmon Meunière", "The crispy skin of this fried hearty salmon\nputs its texture in a class all its own."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_01", "Fruit Pie", "A celebration isn't a celebration until this\nfruit-filled crust hits the table!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_02", "Apple Pie", "The crispy, flaky pie crust and sweet apples\nare a match made in heaven."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_03", "Egg Tart", "You'll know this simple dessert is done\nbaking when it smells just delightful."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_04", "Meat Pie", "You'll need an extra napkin to deal with this\njuicy pie of perfectly baked minced meat."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_05", "Carrot Cake", "Even those who don't like carrots tend to\nenjoy the mild sweetness of this cake."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_06", "Pumpkin Pie", "The intense sweetness of fortified pumpkins\nmakes this dessert popular among children."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_07", "Hot Buttered Apple", "The apple's sweetness has been enhanced\nby smothering it with butter and baking it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_08", "Honeyed Apple", "A juicy sweet-and-sour dish combining\nnewly ripened apples with honey. "},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_09", "Honeyed Fruits", "A dish that combines the thick sweetness of\nhoney with the acidity of sour fruits."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_10", "Plain Crepe", "The simplicity of this dish lets the flavor of its\ningredients shine."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_11", "Wildberry Crepe", "Sweet, tart wildberries are folded into thin,\nspringy dough to make this dessert."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_12", "Nutcake", "Forest nuts give this cake a pleasant texture\nand a simple, understated sweetness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_13", "Fried Bananas", "Children love fried mighty bananas. The trick\nis frying them over very high heat."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_14", "Egg Pudding", "Made by cooking eggs and milk in a special\nmold, its soft texture melts in your mouth."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_15", "Fish Pie", "A mainstay in any fisherman's home, the\ncrisp crust pairs well with the fishy flavor."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_16", "Honey Candy", "A natural sweet, brimming with nutrition and\nmade by stewing fresh honey."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_I_17", "Honey Crepe", "Honey has been drizzled over thin crepes to\nbring out their natural sweetness and flavor."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_01", "Curry Rice", "A favorite all over Hyrule, this simple dish has\na flavor you just won't get tired of."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_02", "Vegetable Curry", "This healthy curry is popular for its mild flavor\nand moderate spiciness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_03", "Seafood Curry", "This dish brims with treasures from the sea.\nIts spice packs a kick, so it's not for kids."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_04", "Poultry Curry", "The savory meat pairs well with the aroma\nof spice in this common curry."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_05", "Prime Poultry Curry", "The secret to this curry's flavor is taking it off\nthe heat while you add the spices."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_06", "Meat Curry", "The heat from the spice allows you to enjoy\nthe large portion of the meat's savoriness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_07", "Prime Meat Curry", "The high-quality meat in this curry has given\nit a deeper taste than most other curries."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_08", "Gourmet Poultry Curry", "Once served in Hyrule Castle, the poultry\nused in this dish is of immensely high quality."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_J_09", "Gourmet Meat Curry", "The high-quality meat used in this prized\ndish satisfies meat and curry lovers alike."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_01", "Meat Stew", "The hearty meat in this mainstay dish leaves\nbellies satisfied all throughout Hyrule."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_02", "Prime Meat Stew", "Letting the large portions of choice cuts of\nmeat simmer brought out their savoriness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_03", "Pumpkin Stew", "Simply simmer a fortified pumpkin to make\nthis dish. A favorite in Kakariko Village."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_04", "Clam Chowder", "The nutritional value of hearty blueshell snail\ncombines with butter and milk in a rich soup."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_05", "Gourmet Meat Stew", "The meat has simmered for so long it melts in\nyour mouth. A true bucket-list meal!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_06", "Cream of Mushroom Soup", "This creamy mushroom and vegetable soup\nis so chunky it eats like a meal!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_07", "Cream of Vegetable Soup", "Made by simmering vegetables in milk, this\nhealthy dish is as simple as its ingredients."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_08", "Carrot Stew", "This simple stew sat simmering for a long time\nto bring out the sweetness of the carrots."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_K_09", "Milk", "Make this by heating up some milk. Drink it\nbefore bed to ensure a good night's sleep."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_L_01", "Monster Stew", "Meat and seafood simmered in monster\nextract. A savory dish despite its ingredients."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_L_02", "Monster Soup", "Using monster extract as a base, this soup's\ndistinct gaminess is either loved or hated."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_L_03", "Monster Cake", "It's said that once you have a taste of this\ncake, you'll never forget its sweetness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_L_04", "Monster Rice Balls", "Rice balls flavored with monster extract.\nTheir unique aroma is not for everyone."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_L_05", "Monster Curry", "This unusual take on curry uses monster\nextract and doesn't rely only on spices."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_M_01", "Wheat Bread", "Made with wheat from the Tabantha region,\nthis soft, springy bread smells just heavenly."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_N_01", "Seafood Paella", "No fisherman's birthday bash would be\ncomplete without this top-shelf seafood dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_N_02", "Fruitcake", "Making ample use of fruits found all over\nHyrule, this cake is a must for celebrations."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_N_03", "Vegetable Omelet", "This home-style dish mixes fluffy eggs with\nchopped vegetables for nutritional balance."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_N_04", "Mushroom Omelet", "The fluffy texture of this omelet is one of the\ngreat joys of this dish, as well as life."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_O_01", "Dubious Food", "It's too gross to even look at. A bizarre smell\nissues forth from this heap. Eating it won't\nhurt you, though...probably."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_O_02", "Rock-Hard Food", "A dish gone awry after adding the wrong\ningredient. Chewing your way through this\nwon't be fun, but it will fill you up when\nyou're between a rock and a hard place."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_P_01", "Fragrant Mushroom Sauté", "The fragrant aroma of this sautéed spice and\nmushroom dish makes your mouth water."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_P_02", "Herb Sauté", "A fragrant mixture of herbs and spices.\nIt's easily recognized by its unique aroma."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_P_03", "Spiced Meat Skewer", "A special Goron spice covers up the scent\nof the meat, allowing its flavor to shine."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_P_04", "Prime Spiced Meat Skewer", "The simple preparation of this steak dish\nbelies its complex taste profile."},
    ItemText{"Item_Cook_P_05", "Gourmet Spiced Meat Skewer", "The rich aroma and juicy texture of this high-\nquality meat puts it in a league of its own."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_00", "Bokoblin Horn", "The severed horn of a Bokoblin, a creature\noften encountered on the plains of Hyrule.\nIt isn't edible, but it can be tossed into a\nstew with some critters to make an elixir."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_01", "Bokoblin Fang", "A tooth obtained from a Bokoblin. It's worn\ndown and not very sharp, but it's still pretty\nhard. Cook it alongside a critter to make\nan elixir."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_02", "Bokoblin Guts", "A rare material obtained by defeating a\nBokoblin. It convulses on its own every now\nand then, which is really creepy, but perhaps\nit has a use."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_03", "Lizalfos Horn", "This winding horn once grew atop the head\nof a Lizalfos. It's too hard to use for cooking,\nbut stores are willing to buy it from you. It\ncan also be used to make elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_04", "Lizalfos Talon", "This talon once grew from the elbow of a\nLizalfos. You can stew it with critters to\nmake elixirs, but it may have some\nother uses, as well."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_05", "Lizalfos Tail", "The severed tail of a Lizalfos. It continues to\nwriggle even after being separated from its\nbody. That kind of vitality makes it highly\nvalued as an ingredient in elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_06", "Moblin Horn", "This splendid horn once grew atop the head\nof a Moblin. It can't be used in normal food\nrecipes, but it does have some use as an\ningredient in making elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_07", "Moblin Fang", "A sharp fang obtained from a Moblin. It's too\nhard to be reshaped into a tool, but it can\nbe tossed into a stew with some critters to\ncreate elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_08", "Moblin Guts", "This prized ingredient can be obtained from\nMoblins. Its odor is too pungent for normal\nfood preparation, but stew it with some\ncritters to make elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_12", "Lynel Horn", "The Lynel this horn once grew upon surely\nmisses it. It's exceptionally hard—so hard\nthat most blades cannot scratch it. Throw\nit into a stew with critters to make elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_13", "Lynel Hoof", "This rare ingredient can be obtained only\nfrom a Lynel's foot. It's larger and heavier\nthan a horse's hoof. It's useful for making\nelixirs but may have uses beyond that."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_14", "Lynel Guts", "This highly sought-after ingredient can only\nbe obtained from a Lynel. It pulses with the\nvitality of a Lynel, a strength that makes it\ninvaluable as an ingredient for elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_15", "Red Chuchu Jelly", "A jiggly substance that normally comes from\na Fire Chuchu. It consistently gives off heat.\nIf struck, it will explode in a ball of flame."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_16", "Yellow Chuchu Jelly", "A jiggly substance that came from an\nElectric Chuchu. Electricity pulses through\nits gelatinous mass. If struck, it will explode\nin a burst of electric current."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_17", "White Chuchu Jelly", "A jiggly substance that came from an\nIce Chuchu. It's cool to the touch, and\nsqueezing it seems to relieve stress.\nIf struck, it will explode in a cold mist."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_18", "Keese Wing", "The wing of a Keese. It's covered with very\nshort, sharp fur. It's not much use by itself,\nbut you can mix it with critters to make\nsomething useful."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_19", "Keese Eyeball", "A rare material dropped by a defeated\nKeese. It's fun to look at, but it doesn't\nseem to have much use at first glance.\nBut it must be good for something..."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_20", "Octorok Tentacle", "This can only be obtained from an Octorok-\ntype enemy. It's too acidic for cooking, but\nit's highly valued as an ingredient for elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_21", "Octorok Eyeball", "This can only be obtained from an Octorok-\ntype enemy. You can sell it to a store, or you\ncan make elixirs with it, but it may have other\nuses, as well."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_24", "Molduga Fin", "A sturdy fin obtained from a Molduga. It can\nbe used to make elixirs, but there may be\nsomeone willing to trade for it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_25", "Molduga Guts", "A giant organ obtained from a Molduga. This\ninvaluable ingredient is hard to come by,\nand its use is shrouded in mystery."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_26", "Ancient Gear", "A gear used in ancient machinery.\nDespite being incredibly old, its build quality\nis leaps and bounds above anything built\nusing current technology. "},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_27", "Ancient Screw", "A screw used in ancient machinery. It's made\nof an unknown material, and no matter how\nmany times it's turned, its threads never\nseem to show signs of wear."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_28", "Ancient Spring", "A spring used in ancient machinery. It is light\nand buoyant enough to float on water, and\nno matter how many times it's compressed,\nit never loses tension."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_29", "Ancient Shaft", "A machine part used in ancient machinery.\nIt's incredibly sturdy, and it's not made of\nany recognizable material. It may come in\nhandy someday."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_30", "Ancient Core", "This crystal was made using lost technology.\nAt one time it was the power source for\nancient machines. This item is very valuable\nto researchers."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_31", "Giant Ancient Core", "A giant energy crystal made using lost\nancient technology. Cores this large are an\nextremely rare find. A researcher would\nprobably know how to use this."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_32", "Hinox Toenail", "A nail obtained from a Hinox. It's as thick\nas a plate of armor and can be stewed\nwith critters to make elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_33", "Hinox Tooth", "A tooth obtained from a Hinox. It's so\nlarge, it's hard to believe it's a real tooth.\nIt can be used to make elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_34", "Hinox Guts", "A giant, smelly Hinox organ of unknown\nfunction. Upon close inspection, it appears to\nbe quivering. It can be used to make an\nelixir, but some say it has other uses, as well."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_38", "Dinraal's Scale", "This precious scale fell from the red spirit\nDinraal. It emanates a great heat. You\ncan use it in cooking, but just eating it\nseems like a waste."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_39", "Dinraal's Claw", "This valuable claw was plucked from the red\nspirit Dinraal. It was extremely hot before it\nwas removed. You could sell it to a store, but\nit must have some other use."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_40", "Chuchu Jelly", "A gelatinous substance that came from a\nChuchu. It's unusable in this state, but\napplying a bit of elemental stimulation will\nchange its form."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_41", "Red Lizalfos Tail", "The severed tail of a Fire-Breath Lizalfos.\nIts flavor makes the flesh inedible, but toss\nit into a stew with some critters, and you'll\nhave yourself a nice elixir."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_42", "Icy Lizalfos Tail", "The severed tail of an Ice-Breath Lizalfos. Its\nhard scales and flesh make it unsuitable for\ncooking, but it's perfect for making elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_43", "Yellow Lizalfos Tail", "The severed tail of an Electric Lizalfos.\nIts powerful stench makes it unappetizing\nand unfit for cooking, but it's highly valued\nas an ingredient for elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_44", "Fire Keese Wing", "A rare Fire Keese wing. There isn't enough\nFire Keese attached to it to burn you, but\nit does have a slight warmth to it. It can\nbe used as an ingredient for elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_45", "Electric Keese Wing", "A rare Electric Keese wing. The part of the\nElectric Keese that produces electricity is not\nin its wings, so it won't shock you. Toss it in\nwith some critters to make elixirs."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_46", "Ice Keese Wing", "A rare Ice Keese wing. Its frozen surface\ngleams attractively, but its usefulness isn't\nreadily apparent."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_47", "Shard of Dinraal's Fang", "This shard fell from the red spirit Dinraal's\nfang. It's exceptionally hard and therefore\nimpossible to process, but apparently it\ncan be used as a material for something."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_48", "Shard of Dinraal's Horn", "This shard chipped and fell off the red spirit\nDinraal. Its horn is said to be the crystallized\npower of fire itself. It sells for a high price,\nbut rumors say there's some other use for it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_49", "Naydra's Scale", "This precious scale fell from the blue spirit\nNaydra. It contains a bitter cold within.\nYou can use it in cooking, but just eating\nit seems like a waste."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_50", "Naydra's Claw", "This valuable claw was plucked from the blue\nspirit Naydra. It was freezing cold before it\nwas removed. You could sell it, but there\nmust be some other use for it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_51", "Shard of Naydra's Fang", "This shard fell from the blue spirit Naydra's\nfang. It's much harder than any metal, so it's\nimpossible to process. Yet rumors say it can\nbe used as a material for something."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_52", "Shard of Naydra's Horn", "This shard chipped and fell off the blue spirit\nNaydra. It's said the horn is the crystallized\npower of ice itself. It sells for quite a bit, but\nrumors say it has some other use."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_53", "Farosh's Scale", "This precious scale fell from the golden spirit\nFarosh. It contains powerful electricity within.\nYou can cook with it, but just eating it seems\nlike a waste."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_54", "Farosh's Claw", "This claw was plucked from the golden spirit\nFarosh. Its electricity was expelled before it\nwas removed, so it's safe to handle. A store\nwill buy it, but it must have some other use."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_55", "Shard of Farosh's Fang", "This shard fell from the golden spirit Farosh's\nfang. It's so hard, hammers bounce right off\nit, so it's impossible to process. Yet rumors\nsay it does have some use as a material."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_56", "Shard of Farosh's Horn", "This shard fell off the golden spirit Farosh.\nIt's said the horn is the crystallized power\nof electricity itself. It sells for a lot, but there\nmust be some other use for it."},
    ItemText{"Item_Enemy_57", "Octo Balloon", "This inflatable Octorok organ has a lot of lift,\nso attach it to items you want to see float.\nHold it in your hands, and then place it on\nan object to attach it."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_A", "Hyrule Bass", "An ordinary fish that can be found all over\nHyrule. It can be eaten raw, but cooking\nit amplifies its healing benefits."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_B", "Hearty Bass", "This large fish lives near the shoreline.\nIts sizable body can store a lot of nutrients.\nWhen cooked into a dish, it will temporarily\nincrease your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_C", "Chillfin Trout", "This blue trout prefers cold bodies of water.\nIts skin contains enzymes that keep its body\ncool, and when cooked into a dish, it will\ntemporarily boost your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_D", "Voltfin Trout", "This trout makes its home in the freshwater\nlakes. Its scales have an insulating\ncompound that, when cooked into a dish,\noffers resistance to electricity."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_E", "Mighty Carp", "This freshwater fish lives alongside its less\nmighty carp ilk. A compound in its liver\npromotes muscle growth. Dishes cooked with\nit will temporarily increase your attack power."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_F", "Mighty Porgy", "This ocean-dwelling fish comes with one rude\nattitude. The compounds in its flesh elevate\nyour competitive spirit when it's cooked into\na dish, thus increasing your attack power."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_G", "Armored Porgy", "This porgy's body is covered in armor-hard\nscales. The compounds in its scales, when\ncooked into a dish, fortify your bones and\ntemporarily boost your defense."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_H", "Armored Carp", "Calcium deposits in the scales of this ancient\nfish make them as hard as armor. Cooking it\ninto a dish will fortify your bones, temporarily\nincreasing your defense."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_I", "Hearty Salmon", "This fish makes its home in cold water, giving\nit extra layers of fat. It temporarily increases\nyour maximum hearts when used in cooking."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_J", "Sizzlefin Trout", "This red trout prefers warm bodies of water.\nIt has a special organ specifically for storing\nheat. When cooked into a dish, it temporarily\nboosts your resistance to the cold."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_K", "Hearty Blueshell Snail", "This snail lives on sandy beaches in large\nnumbers. Its flesh contains a high amount of\nstimulants, so when cooked into a dish, it\ntemporarily increases your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_L", "Staminoka Bass", "This Hyrule bass got to be the biggest fish\nby never getting caught (until now). Its long\nlife results in a cooked dish that will restore\na lot of stamina."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_L_00", "Staminoka Bass x", "This Hyrule bass got to be the biggest fish\nby never getting caught (until now). Its long\nlife results in a cooked dish that will restore\na lot of stamina."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_M", "Sneaky River Snail", "This large, glow-in-the-dark snail lives in\nfresh water. When cooked into a dish, it\nheightens your senses so you can move\nabout silently."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_X", "Stealthfin Trout", "Consuming the bioluminescent compound\nthat makes this fish glow in the dark will\nincrease concentration. Dishes cooked\nwith it will suppress noise when consumed."},
    ItemText{"Item_FishGet_Z", "Sanke Carp", "This wild armored carp has been bred into\na prizewinning fish. Its beautifully colored\nmarkings do not occur in nature. It offers\nno special effects when cooked."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_A", "Apple", "A common fruit found on trees all around\nHyrule. Eat it fresh, or cook it to increase\nits effect."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_B", "Wildberry", "A fruit that grows in cold, snowy regions\nknown for its tangy, sweet flavor. It doesn't\noffer any special effects, but it's a popular\ncooking ingredient."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_C", "Voltfruit", "Cacti found in the Gerudo Desert bear this\nsweet fruit. It's naturally insulated, so when\ncooked into a dish, it provides resistance\nagainst electricity."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_D", "Hearty Durian", "This fruit's mighty odor has earned it the\nnickname \"king of fruits.\" It offers immense\nrestorative powers; dishes cooked with it will\ntemporarily increase your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_E", "Fleet-Lotus Seeds", "The plant that bears these seeds grows near\ndeep water. The roots draw nutrients from the\nwater, which boosts your movement speed\nwhen the seeds are cooked into a dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_E_00", "Fleet-Lotus Seeds x", "The plant that bears these seeds grows near\ndeep water. The roots draw nutrients from the\nwater, which boosts your movement speed\nwhen the seeds are cooked into a dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_F", "Hydromelon", "This resilient fruit can flourish even in the\nheat of the desert. The hydrating liquid\ninside provides a cooling effect that, when\ncooked, increases your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_G", "Palm Fruit", "Fruit from palm trees that grow near the\nocean. It doesn't offer any special effects\nbut will increase your heart recovery\nwhen used as an ingredient."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_H", "Mighty Bananas", "This fruit grows mainly in tropical forests\nof the Faron region. When it's used as an\ningredient, the resulting dish will temporarily\nincrease your attack power."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_I", "Spicy Pepper", "This pepper is exploding with spice.\nCook with it to create dishes that\nwill raise your body temperature and\nhelp you withstand the cold."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_J", "Fortified Pumpkin", "An extremely tough pumpkin raised in village\nfields. When cooked, that toughness\nmanifests itself by considerably\nupping defense."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_K", "Acorn", "Often found on the ground near trees.\nSquirrels adore this nut, so you may have\ncompetition while foraging. Add one to a\nmeal for a nutty seasoning."},
    ItemText{"Item_Fruit_L", "Chickaloo Tree Nut", "Small birds love this nut. You can eat it raw\nfor a minor effect, but it can also be added\nas a spice to other recipes."},
    ItemText{"Item_InsectGet_K", "Razorclaw Crab", "This crab is well known for its exceptionally\nsharp pincers. When cooked, the strength\ncompound in its claws will increase your\nattack power."},
    ItemText{"Item_InsectGet_O", "Ironshell Crab", "This crab's shell is particularly hard. When\ncooked into a dish, its fat and meat bolster\nthe body to increase your defense."},
    ItemText{"Item_InsectGet_Z", "Bright-Eyed Crab", "This crab appears in large numbers when it\nrains. One bite of its delectable meat, and\nyou'll forget all your exhaustion. Replenishes\nyour stamina when cooked into a dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_01", "Cane Sugar", "When boiled with other ingredients, the cane\nbreaks down into a sweet juice necessary\nfor making cakes and other sweets. It's\ncommonly found in ingredients stores."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_02", "Goron Spice", "Made from several types of spices, this\nsecret Goron seasoning has been handed\ndown for generations. An initial wave of\nspiciness paves the way for the sweetness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_03", "Hylian Rice", "This grain is a favorite among residents of\nKakariko Village. It's grown in regions with a\nlot of water and is quite versatile. Used as an\ningredient in things like risotto and rice balls."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_04", "Bird Egg", "A fresh bird egg necessary for making dishes\nsuch as omelets and crepes. You can snag\nthem from birds' nests if you're sneaky.\nNutritious and delicious, perfect for cooking."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_05", "Fresh Milk", "This fresh milk comes from Hateno cows and\nwhite goats kept in the village. It's delicious\non its own but can also be used as an\ningredient in soups and stews."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_05_00", "Fresh Milk x", "This fresh milk comes from Hateno cows and\nwhite goats kept in the village. It's delicious\non its own but can also be used as an\ningredient in soups and stews."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_06", "Goat Butter", "Butter made from the milk of a domesticated\nwhite goat. In addition to being used in\ndishes like stews and meunière, it's often\nused when making cakes and other sweets."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_07", "Tabantha Wheat", "This grain is cultivated extensively on the\nTabantha Plains. It's ground finely with a\nmillstone to be used in cooking. Use it to\nmake things such as stews and breads."},
    ItemText{"Item_Material_08", "Monster Extract", "A result of Kilton's research into monsters,\nthis suspicious spice can be used to punch\nup dishes while cooking. Apparently it can be\nused to make a number of monstrous meals."},
    ItemText{"Item_Meat_01", "Raw Meat", "Meat obtained from animals in plains and\nforests. You can eat it raw, but cooking it will\nmake it more delicious and nutritious."},
    ItemText{"Item_Meat_02", "Raw Prime Meat", "A fresh, high-quality piece of animal meat.\nThis stuff isn't easy to come by, so savor it.\nCook it to recover more hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Meat_06", "Raw Bird Drumstick", "This meat is tougher and chewier than a\nstandard steak. Tastes better cooked."},
    ItemText{"Item_Meat_07", "Raw Bird Thigh", "A high-quality piece of meat that's hard to\ncome by. You can eat it raw, but cooking it\nfirst will recover more hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Meat_11", "Raw Gourmet Meat", "This prized cut of meat is usually from a large\nanimal. Any connoisseur would rank this\ntender, juicy cut of meat \"gourmet.\" Expect\nan exquisite meal when cooking with this."},
    ItemText{"Item_Meat_12", "Raw Whole Bird", "This prized meat can be obtained from\ncertain birds. It gets full points for flavor,\nnutrition, and volume. It pairs perfectly with\nother ingredients or can be enjoyed alone."},
    ItemText{"Item_MushroomGet_D", "Rushroom", "A mushroom that can grow almost anywhere\nbut prefers ceilings and sheer cliffs. Cook it\nbefore eating to temporarily increase your\nmovement speed."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_A", "Stamella Shroom", "A green mushroom that grows near trees in\nthe forest. It's chock-full of natural energy.\nCook it to release its stamina-restoration\nproperties."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_B", "Chillshroom", "Often found at the base of pine trees in cold\nclimates, these mushrooms are cool to the\ntouch and can be used to cook dishes that\nallow you to stay cool even in arid regions."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_C", "Sunshroom", "A bright red mushroom that grows in hot\nclimates. Imbued with the power of heat, \nthey can be used to cook dishes that will\nallow you endure the bitter cold."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_E", "Hylian Shroom", "A common mushroom found near trees\naround Hyrule. Eat it to restore half a heart."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_F", "Hearty Truffle", "This rare mushroom has a rich scent.\nCook it before eating to temporarily\nincrease your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_F_00", "Hearty Truffle x", "This rare mushroom has a rich scent.\nCook it before eating to temporarily\nincrease your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_H", "Zapshroom", "This mushroom grows wild in the Gerudo\nregion. The cap is naturally insulated, so\nwhen used in cooking, it will offer protection\nagainst electricity."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_J", "Silent Shroom", "A strange mushroom that glows softly in\nthe forest at night. Cooking it into a dish\nunlocks the nutrients in its cap, resulting in\na meal that will allow you to move stealthily."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_L", "Razorshroom", "This mushroom is known for the natural slice\nin its cap. Eating it fosters your competitive\nspirit. Use it when cooking to prepare a dish\nthat will increase your strength."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_M", "Ironshroom", "The cap of this mushroom is very hard.\nUse it when cooking to prepare a dish\nthat increases your defense."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_N", "Big Hearty Truffle", "Years of going unpicked have allowed this\nhearty truffle to grow quite large. It's chock-\nfull of nutrients. When cooked into a dish, it\ntemporarily increases your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_N_00", "Big Hearty Truffle x", "Years of going unpicked have allowed this\nhearty truffle to grow quite large. It's chock-\nfull of nutrients. When cooked into a dish, it\ntemporarily increases your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Mushroom_O", "Endura Shroom", "A rare yellowish-orange mushroom. Cook it\nbefore eating to temporarily increase your\nstamina limit."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_A", "Diamond", "The most precious gem one can find in\nHyrule, its signature sparkle has charmed\nHyruleans for generations. As such, it has\nsold for a very high price since ancient times."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_A_00", "Diamond x", "The most precious gem one can find in\nHyrule, its signature sparkle has charmed\nHyruleans for generations. As such, it has\nsold for a very high price since ancient times."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_B", "Ruby", "A precious red gem mined from large ore\ndeposits found throughout Hyrule. Rubies\ncontain the power of fire and have fetched\na high price since ancient times."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_C", "Sapphire", "A precious blue gem mined from natural rock\nformations. Sapphires contain the very\nessence of ice. They've been known to\nfetch a high price since ancient times."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_D", "Topaz", "This precious yellow gem contains the power\nof electricity. It's been known to fetch a\nhigh price since ancient times."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_E", "Opal", "A valuable ore that gives off a mesmerizing\niridescence similar to the inside of a seashell.\nIt contains the power of water."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_F", "Amber", "A fossilized resin with a caramelesque sheen\nto it. It's been valued as a component in\ndecorations and crafting since ancient times."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_G", "Luminous Stone", "This mysterious mineral gives off a pale blue\nglow in the dark, which some believe to be\nsouls of the dead. Apparently, this stone can\nbe used as a base to make special clothing."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_H", "Rock Salt", "Crystallized salt from the ancient sea\ncommonly used to season meals. \nCannot be eaten in this form."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_I", "Flint", "Strike it with a metallic weapon to generate\na spark. This portable fire starter breaks after\none use, but it can create a long-lasting\nflame if you use it near firewood."},
    ItemText{"Item_Ore_J", "Star Fragment", "A mysterious stone fragment that fell from\nthe sky. It looks like it would fetch a good\nprice, but you may be able to use it in\ncertain recipes as well."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_A", "Hyrule Herb", "This healthy herb grows abundantly in the\nplains of Hyrule. Cook it before eating to\nincrease the number of hearts it restores."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_B", "Hearty Radish", "A rare radish that grows best in sunny plains.\nCook it before eating to temporarily increase\nyour maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_C", "Big Hearty Radish", "This hearty radish has grown much larger\nthan the average radish. It's rich in analeptic\ncompounds that, when cooked into a dish,\ntemporarily increase your maximum hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_E", "Cool Safflina", "This medicinal plant grows in high elevations,\nsuch as mountains in the Hebra or Gerudo\nregions. When cooked into a dish, it will\ntemporarily increase your heat resistance."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_F", "Warm Safflina", "This medicinal plant grows in hot regions,\nsuch as the Gerudo Desert. It's warm to the\ntouch and increases your cold resistance\nwhen cooked into a dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_G", "Mighty Thistle", "This medicinal plant is known for its sharp\nthorns and for the fruit it bears. The fruit\ncontains a compound that increases attack\npower when cooked into a dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_H", "Armoranth", "This tough medicinal plant cannot be\nbroken, but it can be cooked. Its\ndurable yet flexible fibers raise your\ndefense when cooked into a dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_I", "Blue Nightshade", "A plant that grows in quieter areas of Hyrule.\nAt night, it gives off a soft glow.\nCook with it to increase your stealth."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_J", "Silent Princess", "This lovely flower was said to have been a\nfavorite of the princess of Hyrule. Once\nfeared to have gone extinct, it's recently\nbeen spotted growing in the wild."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_L", "Electric Safflina", "This medicinal plant grows abundantly in the\nGerudo Desert. Its peculiar fibers conduct\nelectricity, which will increase your electricity\nresistance when cooked into a dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_M", "Swift Carrot", "This carrot is cultivated extensively in\nKakariko Village. It strengthens the legs\nand hips when cooked into a dish, which\nhelps increase your movement speed."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_O", "Swift Violet", "This vitality-rich flower blooms mainly on\ncliffsides. When cooked into a dish, the\nnourishing compounds increase your\nmovement speed."},
    ItemText{"Item_PlantGet_Q", "Endura Carrot", "Highly valued as a medicinal plant, this\ncarrot contains large amounts of nourishing\nenergy. When cooked into a dish, it boosts\nyour stamina beyond its maximum limit."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_01", "Roasted Bass", "A bass that's been cooked whole over an\nopen flame. It's flaky and savory smelling.\nOffers more hearts than the raw version."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_02", "Roasted Hearty Bass", "An open flame has crisped the skin of this\nhearty bass to perfection. It's a sizable\nportion and contains just the right amount\nof fat to create an exceptionally tasty dish."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_03", "Roasted Trout", "This trout can be found all over Hyrule.\nServed river-to-table, it's simply cooked\nfor a soft and flaky flesh with a mild flavor."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_04", "Roasted Hearty Salmon", "A fresh hearty salmon roasted simply over\nan open flame without any additional\nflavoring. Not only is the skin edible, but\nit gives off a rather nice aroma as well."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_07", "Roasted Carp", "Roasting this freshwater carp helped to\nsuppress some of its stench, making it\neasier to stomach. You can really sink\nyour teeth into the thick, meaty flesh."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_09", "Roasted Porgy", "The soft and fluffy texture of this seafaring\nfish has been enhanced by roasting it over\nan open fire. The crisp, aromatic skin is\nparticularly delicious."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_11", "Blueshell Escargot", "The shell of this hearty blueshell snail acted\nas a tiny slow cooker as it was roasted.\nSome people love the trademark bitterness\nof its tail meat."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_13", "Sneaky River Escargot", "Sneaky river snail roasted whole in its shell.\nThe meat is soft and a little chewy. Pulling all\nthe meat from the shell in one go fills you\nwith a sense of accomplishment."},
    ItemText{"Item_RoastFish_15", "Blackened Crab", "A whole crab slow-roasted in its shell. The\nsoft, flaky flesh pairs nicely with the scent\nof the charred shell for a meal that assaults\nall five of your senses in all the best ways."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_01", "Seared Steak", "Raw meat cooked over an open flame.\nCooking it has increased its flavor and the\nnumber of hearts it provides."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_02", "Roasted Bird Drumstick", "Raw bird drumstick that's been cooked to\na crisp, skin and all. It's devoid of seasoning,\nbut it has a simple, accessible taste.\nRestores more hearts than the raw variety."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_03", "Baked Apple", "Direct heat has softened and sweetened\nthis apple. Eat it to restore three quarters\nof a heart."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_04", "Toasty Stamella Shroom", "This toasted stamella shroom doesn't grant\nany special effects, but it will restore\na bit of health."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_05", "Toasted Hearty Truffle", "A hearty truffle with a toasted, crispy outside\nand a warm, gooey inside. "},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_06", "Toasty Hylian Shroom", "A Hylian shroom toasted to perfection.\nThe taste and fragrance are amplified,\nrestoring more health to its consumer."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_07", "Roasted Wildberry", "This wildberry was prepared over an open\nflame to alter its sweet taste. It recovers\nmore health than if eaten raw."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_08", "Roasted Voltfruit", "This voltfruit from the Gerudo Desert has\nbeen charred to really bring out its sweet\nand sour flavors."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_09", "Roasted Hearty Durian", "This hearty durian was roasted whole inside\nits hard shell. Unfortunately, roasting it did\nnothing to remove its distinct odor. Eat it to\nrecover a lot of hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_10", "Baked Palm Fruit", "This palm fruit was broiled with direct heat,\nresulting in steamed flesh inside the rind.\nBest served at the moment the juices\nemerge while roasting."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_11", "Roasted Mighty Bananas", "These mighty bananas have been roasted\nwhole. Cooking them through has turned the\nfruit inside into a sticky, rich, aromatic syrup."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_12", "Roasted Hydromelon", "This hydromelon was roasted whole for\na very soft and flaky inner flesh with a\nrather intriguing flavor. Now this is your\nmoney melon!"},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_13", "Charred Pepper", "A pepper that's been gently caressed by an\nopen flame. It's much less spicy now."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_15", "Baked Fortified Pumpkin", "This fortified pumpkin has been roasted\nwhole. The hard rind serves as a container\nfor the steamed pumpkin flesh inside."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_16", "Roasted Lotus Seeds", "Flame-roasted fleet-lotus seeds.\nPeel the skin back to get to the soft\nand flaky center."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_18", "Roasted Radish", "A roasted hearty radish. Fragrant and\nwarm, it has no special effect but will\nrestore hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_19", "Roasted Big Radish", "A roasted big hearty radish.\nTo take such a precious vegetable\nand put it to the fire is decadent\nin a way."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_24", "Roasted Swift Carrot", "A fragrant swift carrot that's been\nlightly roasted. It doesn't have any\nspecial effects, but it will restore\nsome health."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_27", "Roasted Mighty Thistle", "Lightly toasted mighty thistle. It has no\nspecial effects, but now that it's been grilled,\nthe pointy ends go down smooth."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_28", "Roasted Armoranth", "Simple, roasted armoranth. The heat has\nfrayed the hard, chewy fiber just enough\nto make it easy to eat."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_31", "Toasty Chillshroom", "A fully roasted chillshroom. It's evenly\ntoasted and tastes a lot better than\nwhen eaten raw. Eating it will restore\na bit of health."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_32", "Toasty Sunshroom", "It's always a good idea to keep a fully\nroasted sunshroom or two on hand just\nin case. Eat it to recover a bit of health."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_33", "Toasty Zapshroom", "It's not very shocking that this fully roasted\nzapshroom is delicious. Eat it to recover\na bit of health."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_36", "Toasty Rushroom", "A rushroom that's been put to the torch.\nIt may have lost its speedy properties, but\nat least it tastes good now."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_37", "Toasty Razorshroom", "A razorshroom that's been exposed to\ndirect heat. Its sharp exterior has softened\nconsiderably. Restores a bit of health."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_38", "Toasty Ironshroom", "An ironshroom exposed to an open\nflame. Its once-tough exterior is now crunchy\nand tasty. Restores a bit of health."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_39", "Toasty Silent Shroom", "A whole, toasted silent shroom. High heat\nmay have destroyed its soft glow, but it's\nnow fragrant and tasty."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_40", "Seared Prime Steak", "Raw prime meat cooked over an open flame.\nThe outside is perfectly browned, while\nthe inside is mouthwateringly juicy."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_41", "Roasted Bird Thigh", "Prime meat that's been flame-seared to\nperfection. The outside is crispy, but the\ninside is juicy. Eat it to recover hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_45", "Seared Gourmet Steak", "The highest quality raw gourmet meat, just\nkissed by an open flame. No additional\nseasonings have been added, which lets\nthe natural flavor of the meat really shine."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_46", "Roasted Whole Bird", "This raw whole bird has been tickled by\nan open flame to bring out its flavor. Less\nis more, as the lack of additional seasoning\nallows its natural taste to shine."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_48", "Roasted Acorn", "An acorn cooked with direct heat.\nIts nutty aroma has been amplified."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_49", "Toasted Big Hearty Truffle", "This big hearty truffle has been roasted\nwhole. It gets full points for aroma and\nnutrition. Eat it to recover a lot of hearts."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_50", "Roasted Endura Carrot", "This flame-kissed endura carrot makes for a\ntruly extravagant single-item dish. The fire\nreally brought out its sweetness."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_51", "Campfire Egg", "Roasting a bird egg whole in its shell like this\nhelps retain water, making the egg a bit\nchewier than usual."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_52", "Roasted Tree Nut", "A tree seed roasted to amplify its fragrance.\nGives more hearts than the raw variety."},
    ItemText{"Item_Roast_53", "Toasty Endura Shroom", "A toasted endura shroom. It doesn't grant\nany special effects, but boy is it tasty!"},
    ItemText{"KeySmall", "Small Key", "A key that can unlock doors inside shrines."},
